   "source": [
    "# 🌿 Mint Leaf AI — STEP 8F: External Source Domain Generalization Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "Welcome to **Step 8F** of the Mint Leaf AI project (`14_external_source_domain_validation.ipynb`). In this notebook, we evaluate out-of-distribution (OOD) cross-domain generalization by holding out an entire external source repository during training and evaluating on unseen domain images.\n",
    "\n",
    "--- \n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔬 Step 8F Core Objectives:\n",
    "1. **External Domain Holdout Strategy**: Hold out `SRC_003` Roboflow & `SRC_001` iNaturalist dataset repositories as an unseen external domain.\n",
    "2. **Zero-Tuning Out-of-Distribution Evaluation**: Train contender architectures (`ResNet18`, `ResNet34`, `ResNet50`, `DenseNet121`, `ConvNeXt-Tiny`, `EfficientNet-B0`, `MobileNetV3-Large`, `Swin-T`) strictly on in-domain images and test on unseen external domain images.\n",
    "3. **Domain Shift Degradation Analysis**: Compute F1 drop ($\Delta \\text{F1} = \\text{Internal F1} - \\text{External F1}$) and degradation percentage.\n",
    "4. **Publication-Grade Evidence**: Validate real-world deployment robustness prior to Step 9 model comparison.\n",
    "\n",
    "--- \n",
    "\n",
    "⚠️ **Constraint Checklist**:\n",
    "- [x] Export `external_domain_generalization_results.csv` and `domain_shift_degradation_matrix.csv` under `outputs/reports/model_suite/`.\n",
    "- [x] Export `domain_shift_degradation_chart.png` under `outputs/visualizations/model_suite/`.\n",
    "- [x] Export `external_domain_validation_report.md` and `external_domain_validation_report.json`.\n",
    "- [x] **STOP after Step 8F**: Wait for user review before proceeding to Step 9!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
